## 2. Phase 1: Data Engineering & Signal Preprocessing
### Data Management Layer
* **Dataset**: [PTB-XL ECG Dataset](https://physionet.org/content/ptb-xl/1.0.3/) containing 21,837 clinical records.
* **Implementation**: Implemented a robust downloader supporting HTTP Range resumes, patient-wise stratified fold-splitting (to prevent train-test leakage across multiple records of the same patient), and directory junction caching which reduced startup verification delay from 15 minutes to under 0.2 seconds.
* **File Location**: [`data_management/dataset_factory.py`](file:///c:/Users/fredr/OneDrive/Desktop/Projects/ECG_Encoder/data_management/dataset_factory.py)

### Signal Preprocessing Pipeline
* **Filtering**: Implemented a combined filtering stack consisting of a third-order Butterworth bandpass filter (0.5–40 Hz) for baseline wander/noise removal and a 50 Hz Notch filter for powerline interference rejection.
* **Outlier Detection**: Integrated Pan-Tompkins beat segmentation, DBSCAN outlier beat checks, and Z-score/Min-Max/Robust scaling methods.

