## 6. Phase 5: Explainability (Grad-CAM XAI)
To make the foundation representations clinically auditable, we built an explainability module:
* **Attribution Methods**: Integrated Integrated Gradients (1D), Occlusion Saliency (1D), Grad-CAM (2D over features), and Lead-Specific Guided Grad-CAM.
* **XAI Overlap Metric**: Formulated a `GradCAMTranslator` metric validating temporal overlap between high-saliency segments and annotated waves (P-wave, QRS, T-wave).
* **Code Location**: [`explainability/`](file:///c:/Users/fredr/OneDrive/Desktop/Projects/ECG_Encoder/explainability/) directory.

